---
/** "Ce oferim" features grid, copied from legacy/index.html. */
---

<section class="lp-features" id="ce-oferim">
  <div class="lp-section-header">
    <h2>Tot ce ai nevoie pentru admitere</h2>
    <p>Resurse verificate, organizate de studenți care au trecut deja prin proces.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="lp-features-grid">
    <div class="lp-feature-card">
      <div class="lp-feature-icon">
        <svg
          width="28"
          height="28"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
        >
          <path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z" />
          <path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Subiecte rezolvate</h3>
      <p>
        Rezolvări complete cu explicații detaliate, pas cu pas, pentru fiecare problemă din admiterile
        recente.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-feature-card">
      <div class="lp-feature-icon">
        <svg
          width="28"
          height="28"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
        >
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
          <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Simulări interactive</h3>
      <p>Testează-te cu simulări cronometrate și primești rezultatul instant — exact ca la admitere.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-feature-card">
      <div class="lp-feature-icon">
        <svg
          width="28"
          height="28"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
        >
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
          <polygon points="10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Exerciții video</h3>
      <p>
        Exerciții explicate pas cu pas în format video, cu rezolvări clare pe care le poți revizui oricând.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-feature-card">
      <div class="lp-feature-icon">
        <svg
          width="28"
          height="28"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
        >
          <polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2" />
          <polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17" />
          <polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Resurse complete</h3>
      <p>Informații despre admitere, bareme oficiale și materiale suplimentare — totul centralizat.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
